contentMarkdown:
This card holder has 2 spaces for your cards and 3 other storage spaces for your receipts and other necessities.

It is composed of 2 different leathers colors "fawn" and brick.

This card holder is a prototype with some defects here and there that's why it is sold at 35€ instead of 68€. These defects are only visual, the product is still very strong.

